# suite TSOQUOTE quote to order
ok 1 - CREATE numbers the quote and leaves it DRAFT
ok 2 - ISSUE sends version 1 to the customer
ok 3 - ACCEPT without evidence is refused (SOQ0001)
ok 4 - ACCEPT records how the customer accepted
ok 5 - CONVERT raises an order from the accepted quote
ok 6 - CONVERT defaults the invoiced party
ok 7 - CONVERT defaults the delivery address
ok 8 - CONVERT defaults the payment terms
ok 9 - CONVERT records the trading terms in issue
ok 10 - CONVERT states the VAT treatment basis
ok 11 - the order keeps the quotation provenance
ok 12 - the converted order has no acceptance blockers
ok 13 - a repeated CONVERT returns the first order
ok 14 - the second attempt made no second demand
ok 15 - an expired version cannot be accepted (SOQ0006)
ok 16 - a stated delivery address is not overwritten
1..16
# TSOQUOTE quote to order passed 00016 failed 00000
# exit 0
